Verifies the OTP passed in against the current time OTP.
.INDENT 7.0
.TP
.B Parameters
.INDENT 7.0
.IP \(bu 2
\fBotp\fP \-\- the OTP to check against
.IP \(bu 2
\fBfor_time\fP \-\- Time to check OTP at (defaults to now)
.IP \(bu 2
\fBvalid_window\fP \-\- extends the validity to this many counter ticks before and after the current one
.UNINDENT
.TP
.B Returns
True if verification succeeded, False otherwise
.UNINDENT
